<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot beef trade 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot beef trade 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utility carcasses were steady; Cutters were not established. Demand and offerings were reported moderate. - USDA</p>
<p>____</p>
<p>			  Lds   Price Range    Latest Estb. Mkt.</p>
<p>UT,brk 2-4 450#/up  1.0   52.00		 52.00</p>
<p>UT,bng 1-3 400#/up  2.0   56.00		 56.00</p>
<p>Cutter 1-2 350#/up				  53.00 D</p>
<p>Bulls YG 1 500#/up			    unq</p>
<p>BONELESS PROCESSING BEEF/BEEF TRIMMINGS 95.0 Loads Reported. Lean boneless beef mostly $3.50 lower; 85% mostly off $4.00-5.00; 65% 2.50 lower. Demand and offering light to moderate. Beef trimmings weak on light to moderate demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
